  "2026-09-12T20:04:26.554Z","harness:claude-code","Evidence: rebuilt dist; pm next, pm stats, pm comments print nothing on stderr; pm list-open still prints exactly one Deprecated command hint and ux.deprecation_hints false suppresses it. context-ops-namespace.integration.spec.ts rewritten with the deprecated negative control; 3 tests pass. docs-skills, flag-lexicon and command-grammar gates green on the rebuilt tree. Measured saving: about twelve stderr tokens per hot-path alias call across the 18 permanent relocated spellings the skills instruct."
